tachyon-blueprint 1
# Wolfsgrund, a village in the snow under the mountains, for Grimoire's Bad Moon Rising games.
# Made by town/make-grimm.mjs; edit that and run it again. `label x y Name` names a place.
name grimm
size 100 84 2
key . floor snow
key T wall pine
key : floor soil
key W wall wood
key + floor wood
key ~ floor water
key = floor ice
key R wall granite
key G floor granite
key S wall stone block
key s floor stone block
key < stair-up wood
key > stair-down wood
key , floor snow | fern
key ; floor wood | chest
key _ floor wood | bed
key # floor soil | torch
key % floor wood | table
key & floor wood | candle
key * floor wood | door
key - floor wood | barrel
key ^ floor wood | oven
key " floor water | plank bridge
key ' floor wood | chair
key ` floor wood | hay bale
key ! floor ice | barrel
key ? floor gravel
key $ floor gravel | anvil
key @ floor gravel | brazier
key A floor soil | chair
key B floor gravel | door
key C floor snow | torch
key D floor stone block | well
key E floor snow | cart
key F floor stone block | altar
key H floor stone block | candle
key I floor stone block | pew
key J floor stone block | door
key K floor snow | coffin
key L floor snow | statue
key M floor snow | flowers
key N floor wood | loom
